WEBVTT

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.326
If you want to tackle burnout at scale,

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:05.647
my favorite model
is demand, control, support.

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:08.940
In a nutshell, it says
there are three ways

00:22:08.964 --> 00:22:10.806
to prevent emotional exhaustion.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:12.916
Reduce the demands of the job.

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:15.236
Give people more control to handle them.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:17.923
And provide more support
to help people cope.

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:21.596
To see how demand, control, support works,

00:22:21.620 --> 00:22:25.316
we went to a couple places that deal
with extreme emotional exhaustion,

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:28.881
where burnout is often part
of the job and the culture.

00:22:28.905 --> 00:22:32.001
Adrienne Boissy: You know,
we forget that culture is also a medium